{"unit_id":"xoykor__dsh-searxng#card-zh","repo":"xoykor/dsh-searxng","commit":"d42ebc4aba8fb89caf25489abb4be818a8c1158f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-searxng 是面向 DSH 的 SearXNG 网页搜索提供商插件，通过 DSH web 服务注册 searxng 搜索实现，并向可配置的 SearXNG 实例发送查询、读取 JSON 响应。它会把查询参数编码到搜索请求中，将有效结果的网址、标题、摘要和发布日期映射为 DSH 来源，并传递结果数提示与取消信号。适合希望使用自托管搜索服务的 DSH 用户；需要运行并可访问的 SearXNG 实例，默认地址为本机 8888 端口。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:4-28","cordis.patch.yml:1-3"]}
{"unit_id":"xoykor__dsh-searxng#card-en","repo":"xoykor/dsh-searxng","commit":"d42ebc4aba8fb89caf25489abb4be818a8c1158f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-searxng connects SearXNG to DSH web search by registering a provider that sends queries to a configurable JSON endpoint. It maps valid URLs, titles, and snippets into DSH sources and forwards cancellation signals. Use it with a reachable SearXNG instance; the default is localhost:8888.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:4-28","cordis.patch.yml:1-3"]}
