{"unit_id":"xoykor__dsh-searxng#feature-1","repo":"xoykor/dsh-searxng","commit":"d42ebc4aba8fb89caf25489abb4be818a8c1158f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-searxng 的功能「搜索请求」：将 DSH 的查询发往配置的 SearXNG /search 端点，并附加 JSON 格式参数；可选传入结果数提示，默认使用本机 8888 端口。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:5-14"]}
{"unit_id":"xoykor__dsh-searxng#feature-2","repo":"xoykor/dsh-searxng","commit":"d42ebc4aba8fb89caf25489abb4be818a8c1158f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-searxng 的功能「结果映射」：读取 SearXNG JSON 结果，过滤掉没有有效网址的条目，并把网址、可用标题、摘要和发布日期转换为 DSH 搜索来源。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:16-25"]}
{"unit_id":"xoykor__dsh-searxng#feature-3","repo":"xoykor/dsh-searxng","commit":"d42ebc4aba8fb89caf25489abb4be818a8c1158f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-searxng 的功能「错误与取消」：搜索请求支持传入取消信号；非成功 HTTP 响应会抛出包含状态码的错误，底层传输取消错误则继续传播。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:14-16"]}
{"unit_id":"xoykor__dsh-searxng#caveat-1","repo":"xoykor/dsh-searxng","commit":"d42ebc4aba8fb89caf25489abb4be818a8c1158f","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-searxng 使用前须知：必须有可访问并启用 JSON 输出的 SearXNG 实例；插件仅发起搜索请求，默认连接 http://127.0.0.1:8888。 （见 index.mjs:5,10-16）","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:5-16"]}
